exists su name output ob text quoted.text..text.quoted be text ya

su name fizzbuzz line by num 0 to name text line be ceremony def
exists su name line ob text quoted.text..text.quoted be text ya
exists su name rem3 ob num 0 be number ya
exists su name rem5 ob num 0 be number ya

ob this by from num 3 to name rem3 be remains do
ob this by from num 5 to name rem5 be remains do

ob name rem3 be equally from num 0 then ob text Fizz to name line be add do
ob name rem5 be equally from num 0 then ob text Buzz to name line be add do
ob name line be equally from text quoted.text..text.quoted then ob num of by of this to name line be add do
ob name line ret
su name fizzbuzz line be ceremony prah

su name fizzbuzz build fromindex num 0 toindex num 0 be ceremony def
exists su name line ob text quoted.text..text.quoted be text ya
by num of fromindex of this to name line be fizzbuzz line do
ob name line to name output be add do
ob text quoted.text.
.text.quoted to name output be add do
su name fizzbuzz build be ceremony prah

fromindex num 1 toindex num 16 be fizzbuzz build do
ob name output be write do
